  "title": "Enhancing AI security through global AI red teaming",
  "summary": "Microsoft's External Red Team Alliance (EXTRA) is a global AI security initiative designed to advance AI safety research and red teaming. By partnering with universities, researchers, and regional experts, EXTRA helps identify emerging AI risks, improve security testing, and strengthen the resilience of frontier AI systems.",
